beverage?

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:22.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:24.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like I'm in the roo
with Lomax.

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:26.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:27.240 line:92%
-Colin, you -- we were --

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.442 size:78% position:39%
You know, we e-mailed
this script around

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:30.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
because we were talking abou
doing this,

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:33.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you made an observatio
about Griff Banks,

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:35.481 size:81% position:41%
that it was sort of --
it was foreshadowing

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:37.283
