another character says it.

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:15.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, what was nice is,
we cut to Seth in the middle

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:16.022 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.022 --> 00:04:17.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Klein and I were talking
we were like,

00:04:17.657 --> 00:04:21.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
"That was our mistake at 'SNL.
We should've cut to Lorne.

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:22.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:23.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
It would've been fun.
Just in general,

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:26.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
