the feed from, like,

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:32.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
a different camera.
-Yeah.

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:34.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
-If there was a Lorne-cam,
that would be amazing.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like, mic'd up?
-Yeah.

00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:37.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Throws his wine glass
against the wall --

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:40.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Mother [bleep]"
