"Hamilton."

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hamilton Whiteman.
-Yeah.

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:21.721 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:05:21.721 --> 00:05:24.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
