00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:45.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-In fairness, yeah.

00:05:45.044 --> 00:05:47.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They were really --
they were really kind of bot

00:05:47.046 --> 00:05:49.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
foreshadowing America.
-Truth.

00:05:49.148 --> 00:05:49.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:53.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What's the worst --
Do you have a worst moment

00:05:53.286 --> 00:05:55.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
