as far as --

00:05:55.888 --> 00:05:58.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh...
A worst moment.

00:05:58.891 --> 00:06:01.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Or, like --
-Oh, my favorite moment

00:06:01.094 --> 00:06:04.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
was his son Eddie...
-Yeah.

00:06:04.297 --> 00:06:06.599 line:92%
-Maybe he was 11 at this time.

00:06:06.599 --> 00:06:09.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
Lorne was watching a sketc
of ours on the monitor,

00:06:09.102 --> 00:06:10.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he kept going...
