that were very hurtful, yeah

00:06:24.484 --> 00:06:25.218 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:27.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
-At some point like last year,
I was watching a sketch

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
