and it was not going great

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:32.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he turned to me
under the bleachers, Lorne

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:35.228
and he said, "Do you think
they can take Emmys away?"

00:06:35.228 --> 00:06:39.465 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:39.465 --> 00:06:42.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's a good one.
-Alex Baze, who ran "Update"

00:06:42.335 --> 00:06:44.904
when I was there and is no
the head writer of this show

00:06:44.904 --> 00:06:46.739 line:92%
I did something on "Update."

00:06:46.739 --> 00:06:49.308 line:92%
I tried a new thing where...

00:06:49.308 --> 00:06:52.478
I basically looked through
a magnifying glass at some point

00:06:52.478 --> 00:06:54.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
