[ Laughter ]

00:07:03.156 --> 00:07:05.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which I don't --
Looking back, I don't thin

00:07:05.591 --> 00:07:08.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
Baze should've told me.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:08.494 --> 00:07:12.832
-We had a game-show host onc
named Robert Blaze, I think.

00:07:12.832 --> 00:07:15.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Lorne went,
"Everyone's confused

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:17.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
